<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - JCI JUNE QTR PRE-CAPEX NET PLUMMETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - JCI JUNE QTR PRE-CAPEX NET PLUMMETS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the quarter to</p>
<p>end-June versus preceding quarter.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending  16.37     vs 42.27**</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			  10,252    vs 10,676</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		   2,563,000 vs 2,671,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    4.00	vs 4.00</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			    52,133    vs 50,654</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			 52,428    vs 52,819</p>
<p>** previous quarter net profit adjusted to reflect</p>
<p>apportionment over fiscal year of accrued tax liability on</p>
<p>non-mining income at H.J. Joel.</p>
<p>Full name: JCI Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Aggregate results for JCI Ltd's three gold mines,</p>
<p>Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co, Western Areas Gold Mining Co</p>
<p>Ltd and HJ Joel Gold Mining Co.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
